SUMMARY:DAN LAMORTE
LOCATION:Mic Drop Comedy Chandler\, 51 E. Boston St.\, Chandler
DESCRIPTION:Dan LaMorte is a distinct\nvoice in stand-up comedy—and not j
 ust because he’s on the spectrum. He\nbegan his comedy career at 19\, aft
 er a college baseball injury ended his\nathletic ambitions. Dan made appear
 ances on Fox’s Red Eye \, AXS TV’s Gotham Comedy Live \, Getting Doug w
 ith High \, and\, as he jokes\, nearly every drive-thru in the Tri-state ar
 ea. His two albums\, Not Enough Pieces and Infect Me Once \, remain popular
  on SiriusXM and have collectively earned over a million streams on Pandora
 .\n\nBy 23\, Dan had built a promising comedy\nrésumé—and a 354-pound b
 ody. But a diagnosis of fatty liver disease\nsparked a dramatic lifestyle c
 hange. Over the next three years\, he lost\nmore than 185 pounds\, became a
 n ultra runner (competing in races longer\nthan marathons)\, and inspired c
 ountless fans to pursue their own\nwellness journeys. The transformation ma
 y have reshaped his life\, but\nhis sharp\, self-aware humor remains unchan
 ged.\n\nIn 2023\, Dan was selected as a New Face at\nthe prestigious Just F
 or Laughs Comedy Festival in Montreal. He followed\nit up with a standout D
 on’t Tell Comedy set\, released in 2024.\nBased in New York City\, Dan is
  a regular at the Comedy Cellar\, The\nStand\, and other top clubs—contin
 uing to bring his unique perspective\,\nresilience\, and punchlines to audi
 ences nationwide.\n\nAges 18+\nFee applies if transferring confirmed ticket
  purchase to another guest.\nDoors for open for seating approximately 30 mi
 nutes before late showtimes. Please note\, doors are subject to prior show 
 endtime and may change without notice\, beyond our control.\nNo refunds or 
 exchanges.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/dan-lamor
 te-22301/
